  "question": {
    "text": "Two engines pass each other moving in opposite directions with uniform speed of 30 m/s. one of them is blowing a whistle of frequency 540 Hz. Calculate the frequency heard by driver of second engine before they pass each other. speed of sound is 330 m/sec:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "fYnzv",
      "text": "450 Hz",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dveYf",
      "text": "540 Hz",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DEfMJ",
      "text": "270 Hz",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "mZetE",
      "text": "648 Hz",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "From Doppler&#39;s effect of sound, apparent frequency is given by,&nbsp;<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&#38;</mo><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;represents&nbsp;velocity of sound, velocity of observer, velocity of source and frequency of source repectively.<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>540</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>360</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>540</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>648</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math>",
